      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "After the publication of this work [1] it was noticed that on page 3 of the article beginning in the paragraph-'Hydrazide 14 is used as a key producer\u2026' the compound-\"Not ethyl-N'-5-amino-1,3-diphenyl-1H-thieno[3,2-c]pyrazole-6-carbonylformohydrazonate\" should be deleted. Also on page 10 of the PDF beginning in paragraph-'Synthesis of 5-amino-\u2026' the compound-\"Not ethyl-N'-5-amino-1,3-diphenyl-1H-thieno[3,2-c]pyrazole-6-carbonylformohydrazonate\" should be deleted. We apologise for these errors."},
